cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Reproduction package: Early Query-Key Learning Determines the Grokking Delay in Modular Addition"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jin
    given-names: Zhengzhong
    affiliation: "East China University of Science and Technology, Shanghai, China"
    email: 2643303025@qq.com
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for a study of the grokking delay in a one-layer
  Transformer trained on modular addition (c = a + b mod 113).  It contains
  per-claim run and verification scripts, archived per-seed result files, the
  seal manifest with sha256 checksums for every file and external anchor, and
  the recorded 10-seed verdicts.  The package separates two verification
  tiers: a bit-exact anchor tier (meaningful only on the seal machine) and a
  behavioural verdict tier (portable to any environment).
version: "1.16+tenseed"
date-released: "2026-09-11"
